<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the $926,250</p>
<p>Italian Open women's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seed):</p>
<p>10-Mary Pierce (France) beat 3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Women's doubles final:</p>
<p>2-Nicole Arendt (U.S)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>6-Conchita Martinez (Spain)/Patricia Tarabini (Argentina) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
